# EO-IC100 04e8:a05b IF4 HID report descriptor (20 bytes), read on the Switch by eoprobe (2026-10-20).
# Vendor page 0xFEFF, report ID 2, 3 bytes (FM radio notifications). Logical Maximum is encoded as
# '25 ff' = -1 < Logical Minimum 0, which is invalid: Windows fails this interface with Code 10.
06 ff fe 09 01 a1 01 85 02 15 00 25 ff 75 08 95
03 81 02 c0
